            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Nn0DK",
              "name": "Desc",
              "fill": "$f-ink-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1080,
              "content": "D’s apparatus, E’s manners. Every technical device from the manual survives — change bars, the three severity tiers, page furniture, task numbering, the mass-flow schematic. What goes is the boxing: rules appear only where data genuinely needs them, and everything else is separated by air and a change of type.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$f-sans",
              "fontSize": 21,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
