                                        },
                                        "yzCTh": {
                                          "content": "Coriander is the one that matters"
                                        },
                                        "x6hpfW": {
                                          "content": "Ground with everything else it goes to powder; ground alone and coarsely it stays as visible pieces in the finished cure. That visibility is the point of the whole grind."
