                                          "name": "Body",
                                          "fill": "$f-ink",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "# Pickled jalapeños\n\nBerlin, August. Jars from the Turkish shop on Karl-Marx.\n\n- 500 g jalapeños, sliced into rings\n- 2 cloves garlic, smashed\n- 240 g white wine vinegar\n- 240 g water\n- 2 tbsp sugar\n- 1 tbsp fine salt\n- 1 tsp coriander seed, cracked\n- a few black peppercorns\n- olive oil, to cover\n\nBoil everything but the chillies and the oil. Pour it over\nthem hot in the jar and float a finger of oil on top.\n\nLeave a week before opening. They are harsh before that;\nby the third week they are right.",
                                          "lineHeight": 1.8,
                                          "fontFamily": "$f-mono",
                                          "fontSize": 12,
                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
