                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "Eleven notes written before there was a catalogue: three years of notebook pages, printouts and scraps that the recipes were read out of. They are kept exactly as they were found, under the path each file still has in the repository.",
