                                "N9fiB": {
                                  "content": "There is no tool here that edits and none that deletes. add_state writes a new revision and leaves every earlier one exactly where it was, so a revision that has been recorded can never be removed — not by an agent, not by the administrator, not by mistake. If an agent gets something wrong, the correction is another revision written after it, and both of them stay on the record for good."
