                                  "fill": "$fd-accent"
                                },
                                "WkNzs": {
                                  "content": "45.2 g and 2 oz of red wine vinegar are both weights, so the list adds them and reads 101.9 g. Two cloves of garlic and ten heads of garlic are not the same measure of anything, so they are kept apart on one line rather than guessed at. Four ingredients are held apart this way. Where an recipe gives no quantity at all the amount reads “some” and the original words are printed beside it.",
