                                          "fill": "$fd-ink"
                                        },
                                        "vtUZm": {
                                          "content": "Egg white and ice are stirred into cold stock and the pot is reheated slowly. Coagulating albumen forms a raft that traps fine particulate and carries it to the surface, taking the cloudiness with it.",
